    narr:narration """This is the voice profile of Scarlet Dame, drawn from a single session dated inside the anchors. The through-line is an architecture argument: [a directive to slow down and not carry prior rulings into new sessions](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_6), [a tightly controlled unit of expand that always returns context, never a single position](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_9), and [a listing scheme where calls and narratives carry identifiers while their contents render as frames](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_10). She specifies [what a document page must show at navigational fidelity](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_11), [what belongs in a file dump and what breaks the navigator](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_12), and [a tentative framing of calls as the unit of expansion](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_15), asking collaborators to [name the approach, deferring to a better suggestion](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_16). The steering-versus-recall thread runs through [an ordering principle of steering, recall, then precision](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_19), [a statement's meaning living in its strata and position](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21), and [a split between a steering engine they own and a recall engine they don't](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40). On evaluation she presses hard: [a questionable metric that assumes production is right](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_26), [a judged-set built by multiple models with ambiguity preserved](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_28), [small-model trust by confirmation, not faith](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_29), [challenges on pool exhaustiveness](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_31), and [dissatisfaction with a recall figure and a demand to understand the gap](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_33). She also rules on [output caps as circuit breakers, not throttles](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_34), [a supersession question about transaction siblings](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_36), and closes on [a principle of standing on existing components rather than rolling new ones](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_43).""" ;
